1
00:00:00,197 --> 00:00:03,117
(Mrs Cooper:)...I will put you over my knee
right here in this restaurant.

2
00:00:04,952 --> 00:00:06,992
(Leonard:)Please pester her. Please, for me.

3
00:00:11,041 --> 00:00:13,211
(Leonard:)Mrs. Cooper,
what did you think of the sushi?

4
00:00:13,377 --> 00:00:17,547
(Mrs Cooper:)Good. The only thing that would have
made it better, if it was cooked.

5
00:00:19,008 --> 00:00:21,218
(Mrs Cooper:)And if it was beef.

6
00:00:22,344 --> 00:00:25,304
(Mrs Cooper:)Sheldon, when is your landlord
gonna fix the elevator?

7
00:00:25,472 --> 00:00:26,802
(Sheldon:)I don't know.

8
00:00:26,974 --> 00:00:32,184
(Sheldon:)Lately, we've been talking
about converting it into a missile silo.

9
00:00:32,938 --> 00:00:37,648
(Leonard:)Your son seems to think we need to
Iaunch a preemptive strike on Burbank.

10
00:00:38,360 --> 00:00:41,070
(Sheldon:)Get them before they get us.

11
00:00:46,994 --> 00:00:50,454
(Raj(Sitting against their front door, drinking a beer):)Hey, look who decided to show up.

12
00:00:51,415 --> 00:00:52,585
(Leonard:)Raj, what are you doing?

13
00:00:52,750 --> 00:00:56,590
Well, I couldn't find you guys
so I bought six new friends.

14
00:00:58,547 --> 00:01:01,337
(Raj:)Three, sadly, are dead.

